        "original_id": "c219d114-2a82-58bb-b601-d775e9c4b0a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rolls Gracie, Royler Gracie, Rickson Gracie, Carlos Gracie Jr., Márcio Stambowsky, Rigan Machado, Romero Cavalcanti, Hélio Gracie\n- Organizations: Gracie Humaitá school\n- Places: Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, San Diego\n- Roles: Brazilian martial artist, teacher\n\nFacts:\n- Rolls Gracie was a Brazilian martial artist who lived from 1951 to 1982.\n- Rolls Gracie taught Rickson Gracie, Carlos Gracie Jr., Royler Gracie, Márcio \"Macarrão\" Stambowsky, Rigan Machado, and Romero \"Jacare\" Cavalcanti.\n- Royler Gracie ran the Gracie Humaitá school in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil for many years under his father Hélio Gracie's direction.\n- Royler Gracie currently lives in San Diego.",
